From 62bea272d456a42b00bf388036db8a2b228061e9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gili Tzabari <cowwoc2020@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 12:13:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Select the AWS-LC C11 dialect without a conflicting default

Base: rust-v0.162.1 (092d3acd6bec3e3a14bdc7e7a2810ab628ab759d) with the existing issue-61 queue and native MSVC analysis fixture. RED: AWS-LC crypto and SSL C actions contain both /std:c17 and /std:c11. GREEN: both action tests select /std:c11 once and retain /WX. Evidence: windows-wrapper-gbpNjj aws-lc-standard-red.log and compiler-flags-batch-green.log. Fresh emitted patch and full native Windows execution remain required gates.
---
